msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/descr"
msgstr "Fires a shot that damages the target and nearby enemy vehicles."

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Fires a shot that damages the target and all enemy vehicles"
" within a 35 m radius. If used at least once in a battle, the device is "
"spent and can be resupplied for credits. If not used, no resupply is "
"needed.<br /><br />Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last "
"Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br />All unused devices will be removed "
"and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/name"
msgstr "Energy Shot"

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Fires a shot that damages the target and all enemy vehicles within a 35 m "
"radius."

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_aoeDamageInstantShot/short_special"
msgstr "Fires a shot that damages the target and nearby enemy vehicles."

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/descr"
msgstr ""
"Fires a shot that restores hit points by stealing them from the target and "
"nearby enemy vehicles."

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Fires a shot that restores hit points by stealing them from"
" the target and nearby enemy vehicles within a 35 m radius, as well as "
"repairing damaged modules and removing the stun effect. If used at least "
"once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied for credits. If "
"not used, no resupply is needed.<br /><br />Only available during the <font "
"color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br />All unused "
"devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their "
"cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/name"
msgstr "Vampiric Shot"

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Fires a shot that restores hit points by stealing them from the target and "
"nearby enemy vehicles within a 35 m radius, as well as repairing damaged "
"modules and removing the stun effect."

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_aoeDrainEnemyHpInstantShot/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Fires a shot that restores hit points by stealing them from the target and "
"nearby enemy vehicles."

