msgid "LS_aoeStunInstantShot/short_special"
msgstr "Fires a shot that stuns the target and nearby enemy vehicles."

msgid "LS_damageShield/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_damageShield/descr"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability."

msgid "LS_damageShield/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Creates an energy shield that protects your vehicle from "
"any damage except ramming, drowning, and impact for 7 s. If used at least "
"once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied for credits. If "
"not used, no resupply is needed.<br /><br />Only available during the <font "
"color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br />All unused "
"devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their "
"cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_damageShield/name"
msgstr "Energy Shield"

msgid "LS_damageShield/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Creates an energy shield that protects your vehicle from any damage except "
"ramming, drowning, and impact for 7 s."

msgid "LS_damageShield/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_damageShield/short_special"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/descr"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Your next successful shot causes double damage. If used at "
"least once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied for "
"credits. If not used, no resupply is needed. <br /><br />Only available "
"during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br"
" />All unused devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to "
"50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/name"
msgstr "Double Damage"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/onUse"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_doubleDamage/short_special"
msgstr "Your next successful shot causes double damage."

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/descr"
msgstr ""
"Gives a chance to deal increased damage to an enemy vehicle.\n"
"Activation chance: 50%."

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Gives a chance to deal increased damage to an enemy vehicle."
" Activates automatically with a 50% chance with a shot, ram, or other "
"ability, for example Energy Shot. Can be used multiple times in a battle. "
"Removed after being used at least once in a battle.<br /><br />Only "
"available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Proving Ground</font>"
" event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will be removed and compensated in "
"credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/name"
msgstr "Situational Damage"

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Gives a chance to deal <font color='#feab34'>increased damage</font> to an enemy vehicle with a shot, ram, or other ability, for example Energy Shot.\n"
"Activation chance: <font color='#e9e2bf'>50%</font>."

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_extraDamageSituational/short_special"
msgstr "Gives a chance to deal increased damage to an enemy vehicle."

msgid "LS_fastReload/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_fastReload/descr"
msgstr "Increases rate of fire / reloads magazine."

msgid "LS_fastReload/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Significantly accelerates the loading of a cyclic gun for a"
" period of time, or instantly reloads guns with magazine reloading systems. "
"If used at least once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied"
" for credits. If not used, no resupply is needed.<br /><br />Only available "
"during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br"
" />All unused devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to "
"50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_fastReload/name"
msgstr "Fast Reload"

msgid "LS_fastReload/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Significantly accelerates the loading of a cyclic gun/shell loading for a "
"period of time or instantly reloads the magazine."

msgid "LS_fastReload/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_fastReload/short_special"
msgstr "Increases rate of fire / reloads magazine."

msgid "LS_healSituational/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_healSituational/descr"
msgstr ""
"Restores some hit points after destroying an enemy vehicle.\n"
"Activation chance: 50%."

msgid "LS_healSituational/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Instantly restores 500 hit points to your vehicle after "
"destroying an enemy vehicle. Extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and"
" repairs damaged modules. Activates automatically with a 50% chance in case "
"of damage, stun, or critically damaged modules. Can be used multiple times "
"in a battle. Removed after being used at least once in a battle. <br /><br "
"/>Only available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Proving "
"Ground</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will be removed and "
"compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_healSituational/name"
msgstr "Situational Repairs"

msgid "LS_healSituational/onUse"
msgstr ""
"• Instantly <font color='#FEAB34'>restores 500 hit points</font> to your vehicle after destroying an enemy vehicle.\n"
"• Extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and repairs damaged modules.\n"
"• Activates automatically in case of damage, stun, or critically damaged modules.\n"
"• Activation chance: <font color='#E9E2BF'>50%</font>."

msgid "LS_healSituational/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_healSituational/short_special"
msgstr "Restores some hit points after destroying an enemy vehicle."

msgid "LS_invisibility/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_invisibility/descr"
msgstr ""
"Stops enemies from targeting your vehicle, restores hit points, repairs "
"modules, and extinguishes fire."

msgid "LS_invisibility/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Stops enemies from targeting your vehicle for 10 s. "
"Restores 32 HP per second, instantly repairs modules, extinguishes fire, "
"removes the stun effect, and treats all injured crew members. Causing or "
"receiving damage from an enemy vehicle (by firing, ramming, or using "
"Tactical Devices) will reveal your position immediately. If used at least "
"once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied for credits. If "
"not used, no resupply is needed.<br/><br/>Only available during the <font "
"color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br/><br/>All unused "
"devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to 50% of their "
"cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_invisibility/name"
msgstr "Shadow Heal"

msgid "LS_invisibility/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Stops enemies from targeting your vehicle for 10 s. Restores 32 HP per "
"second, instantly repairs modules, extinguishes fire, removes the stun "
"effect, and treats all injured crew members. Causing or receiving damage "
"from an enemy vehicle (by firing, ramming, or using Tactical Devices) will "
"reveal your position immediately."

msgid "LS_invisibility/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_invisibility/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Temporarily stops enemies from targeting your vehicle, restores hit points, "
"repairs modules, extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and treats all "
"injured crew members."

msgid "LS_nitro/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_nitro/descr"
msgstr "Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility."

msgid "LS_nitro/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility. If used at "
"least once in a battle, the device is spent and can be resupplied for "
"credits. If not used, no resupply is needed.<br /><br />Only available "
"during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> event.<br /><br"
" />All unused devices will be removed and compensated in credits equal to "
"50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_nitro/name"
msgstr "Turbocharger"

msgid "LS_nitro/onUse"
msgstr "Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility."

msgid "LS_nitro/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_nitro/short_special"
msgstr "Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility."

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/descr"
msgstr ""
"Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility after taking damage from an enemy vehicle.\n"
"Activation chance: 50%."

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility after taking "
"damage from an enemy vehicle. Activates automatically with a 50% chance. If "
"used at least once in a battle, the ability is spent and can be resupplied "
"for credits. If not used, no resupply is needed.<br /><br />Only available "
"during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Proving Ground</font> event.<br"
" /><br />All unused abilities will be removed and compensated in credits "
"equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/name"
msgstr "Situational Mobility"

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Temporarily <font color='#feab34'>increases</font> your vehicle's <font color='#feab34'>mobility</font> after taking damage from an enemy vehicle .\n"
"Activation chance: <font color='#e9e2bf'>50%</font>."

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_nitroSituational/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Temporarily increases your vehicle's mobility after taking damage from an "
"enemy vehicle."

msgid "LS_selfRepair/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_selfRepair/descr"
msgstr ""
"Restores hit points, extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and repairs"
" damaged modules."

msgid "LS_selfRepair/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Combat Ability. Restores hit points, extinguishes fire, removes the stun "
"effect, and repairs damaged modules. Can be used multiple times in a battle."
" Removed after being used at least once in a battle.<br /><br />Only "
"available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Operation "
"Pandora</font> event.<br /><br />All unused abilities will be removed and "
"compensated in credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_selfRepair/name"
msgstr "Emergency Repairs"

msgid "LS_selfRepair/onUse"
msgstr ""
"• Instantly restores 400 hit points to your vehicle.\n"
"• Restores an extra 300 hit points within 30 s.\n"
"• Restoration is interrupted upon receiving damage.\n"
"• Extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and repairs damaged modules.\n"
"• Can only be activated in case of damage."

msgid "LS_selfRepair/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_selfRepair/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Restores hit points, extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and repairs"
" damaged modules."

msgid "LS_selfRepair/usageCost"
msgstr "• Mirium cost to use in battle:"

msgid "LS_teamRepair/always"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_teamRepair/descr"
msgstr ""
"Repairs and restores some hit points to allied vehicles within its radius."

msgid "LS_teamRepair/long_special"
msgstr ""
"Tactical Device. Instantly repairs modules, extinguishes fire, removes the "
"stun effect, and restores some hit points to allied vehicles within its "
"radius. If used at least once in a battle, the device is spent and can be "
"resupplied for credits. If not used, no resupply is needed.<br/><br />Only "
"available during the <font color='#cbac77'>Last Stand: Invasion</font> "
"event.<br/><br/>All unused devices will be removed and compensated in "
"credits equal to 50% of their cost in the next update."

msgid "LS_teamRepair/name"
msgstr "Group Repairs"

msgid "LS_teamRepair/onUse"
msgstr ""
"Instantly repairs modules, extinguishes fire, removes the stun effect, and "
"restores some hit points to allied vehicles within its radius."

msgid "LS_teamRepair/restriction"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "LS_teamRepair/short_special"
msgstr ""
"Repairs and restores some hit points to allied vehicles within its radius."

